Subject: [PATCH] target/m68k: packed decimal store with a dynamic k-factor

fmove.p fpN,<ea>{Dn} has destination format 7, which ext_opsize did not
know: translating it aborted QEMU.  Treat it as packed, which the 68040
leaves to software through the unimplemented data type exception, as for
the static k-factor form.

--- a/target/m68k/translate.c
+++ b/target/m68k/translate.c
@@ -661,6 +661,7 @@
     case 4: return OS_WORD;
     case 5: return OS_DOUBLE;
     case 6: return OS_BYTE;
+    case 7: return OS_PACKED; /* fmove.p out with a dynamic k-factor */
     default:
         g_assert_not_reached();
     }
